/// 图谱基类。
/// Graph base class.
/// 具体持久类继承本类后，其“图属性”由两种方式确定：显式在属性上设置 Direction 参数；
/// After a concrete persistent class inherits this class, its "graph properties" are determined in two ways: explicitly setting the Direction parameter on a property;
/// 或当类参数 Auto=1 时，按 schema 自动把持久化对象引用属性识别为图属性（可用 GraphUse=0 排除）。
/// or, when class parameter Auto=1, automatically recognizing persistent object reference properties as graph properties by schema (can be excluded with GraphUse=0).
/// 图数据的维护改由功能索引 Graph.Object.Index 完成（经投影 Graph.Object.IndexProjection 在编译期自动注入）：
/// Graph data maintenance is now done by the functional index Graph.Object.Index (auto-injected at compile time via the projection Graph.Object.IndexProjection):
///   ^GraphData.Dic(SourceType, Relation, TargetType, Inverse) = PropName   -- 图字典（本类编译期生成）
///   ^GraphData.Dic(SourceType, Relation, TargetType, Inverse) = PropName   -- graph dictionary (generated by this class at compile time)
///   ^GraphData.OUT(Layer, SourceNodeOID, TargetNodeOID, Relation) = ""      -- 边（供查询）
///   ^GraphData.OUT(Layer, SourceNodeOID, TargetNodeOID, Relation) = ""      -- edge (for queries)
///   ^GraphData.OWN(Layer, OwnerNodeOID, SourceNodeOID, Relation, TargetNodeOID)=""-- owner→边（供维护）
///   ^GraphData.OWN(Layer, OwnerNodeOID, SourceNodeOID, Relation, TargetNodeOID)=""-- owner->edge (for maintenance)
/// Author: QP
/// Version: 2.0
/// Last Modified Date: 2026/07/26
Class Graph.Object.Base [ Abstract, PropertyClass = Graph.Object.PropertyParameters, System = 3 ]
{

/// 是否按类 schema 自动为对象属性注入 Graph 定义参数（默认 "0" 关闭；未定义时亦按 "0" 处理）。
/// Whether to auto-inject Graph definition parameters into object properties by class schema (default "0" = off; also treated as "0" when undefined).
/// Auto=1 时，投影 Graph.Object.IndexProjection 在编译期把 Direction=TO / Relation=属性名 / Inverse=0
/// When Auto=1, the projection Graph.Object.IndexProjection at compile time writes Direction=TO / Relation=property name / Inverse=0
/// 显式写入符合条件的属性定义；随后图字典与边维护按已注入的 Direction 参数工作。
/// explicitly into qualifying property definitions; afterwards the graph dictionary and edge maintenance work by the injected Direction parameter.
/// 注意：不对 %SerialObject 属性、字面量数据类型创建 Graph 定义，也不对父子关系父方(children)、
/// Note: no Graph definition is created for %SerialObject properties or literal datatypes, nor for the parent-child relationship parent side (children),
/// 一对多关系一方(many)创建；已显式声明 Direction 的属性保持不变；GraphUse=0 可显式排除。
/// nor for the one-to-many relationship one side (many); properties that explicitly declare Direction remain unchanged; GraphUse=0 can explicitly exclude.
Parameter Auto As STRING = "0";

/// 本类对象的图边写入的层名（见 Graph.Layer）；空=进程上下文/默认写入层。运行期解析，修改后无需重编译子类。
/// Layer name that this class's graph edges are written to (see Graph.Layer); empty = process context / default write layer. Resolved at runtime, no subclass recompile needed.
Parameter GRAPHLAYER As STRING = "";
/// 功能索引投影：使每个具体子类编译时自动获得
/// Functional index projection: makes each concrete subclass automatically obtain at compile time
///   GraphIndex             （所有标量图属性）
///   GraphIndex             (all scalar graph properties)
///   GraphIndexE<集合属性>  （每个 list/array 图属性，On Prop(ELEMENTS)）
///   GraphIndexE<CollectionProp>  (each list/array graph property, On Prop(ELEMENTS))
/// 从而在对象/SQL 的插入、更新、删除时维护 ^GraphData.OUT / ^GraphData.OWN。
/// thereby maintaining ^GraphData.OUT / ^GraphData.OWN on object/SQL insert, update, and delete.
Projection GraphIdxProj As Graph.Object.IndexProjection;

/// 编译期生成图字典 ^GraphData.Dic。
/// Generate the graph dictionary ^GraphData.Dic at compile time.
/// 对每个带 Direction 参数的属性（含 Auto=1 时由投影注入者），记录 源类型/关系/目标类型/Inverse -> 属性名。
/// For each property with a Direction parameter (including those injected by the projection when Auto=1), record source type/relation/target type/Inverse -> property name.
Method GraphDictionary() [ CodeMode = objectgenerator ]
{
    Set tKey = ""
    Set tProperty = %compiledclass.Properties.GetNext(.tKey)
    While (tKey '= "") 
    {
        Set tName = tProperty.Name
        If ($Extract(tName, 1) '= "%") 
        {
            Set tDirection = tProperty.Parameters.GetAt("Direction")
            Set tRelation = tProperty.Parameters.GetAt("Relation")
            Set tInverse = tProperty.Parameters.GetAt("Inverse")
            Set tTargetType = tProperty.Type
            If (tDirection '= "") 
            {
                Set:(tRelation = "") tRelation = tName
                Set:(tInverse = "") tInverse = 0
                Set ^GraphData.Dic(%compiledclass.Name, tRelation, tTargetType, tInverse) = tName
            }
        }
        Set tProperty = %compiledclass.Properties.GetNext(.tKey)
    }
    Quit $$$OK
}

/// 业务号 → 节点OID 的解析方法（占位实现，**必须由业务子类重写**）。
/// Method that resolves a business number to a node OID (placeholder implementation, **must be overridden by business subclasses**).
/// 契约：根据业务号 pNO 返回对应记录的节点OID，形如 $ListBuild(Id, $classname())；
/// Contract: given business number pNO, return the node OID of the corresponding record, of the form $ListBuild(Id, $classname());
///       未找到时返回 ""。
///       return "" when not found.
/// 供 Graph.Object.Tools（GetOID / *WithNO 等按业务号查询的方法）与
/// Called by Graph.Object.Tools (GetOID / *WithNO and other methods that query by business number) and
/// Graph.REST 的节点解析调用。
/// the node resolution of Graph.REST.
/// 本基类不提供具体实现，直接返回“未实现”错误，以提示子类必须重写本方法。
/// This base class provides no concrete implementation and returns a "not implemented" error to indicate subclasses must override this method.
ClassMethod GetOIDByNO(pNO As %String) As %String
{
    Quit $$$ERROR($$$NotImplemented)
}

}
